{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23666","headline":"华城西北雉堞最高崔相公首创楼台钱左丞继种花果合爲胜境题在雅篇岁暮独游怅然成咏 · 白居易","name":"华城西北雉堞最高崔相公首创楼台钱左丞继种花果合爲胜境题在雅篇岁暮独游怅然成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高居称君子，潇洒四无邻。\n丞相栋梁久，使君桃李新。\n凝情看丽句，驻步想清尘。\n况是寒天客，楼空无主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}